す。彼女の頭のディテールに細心の注意を払ってください。彼女は優しくてエレガントですが、吸血鬼のように密かに血に飢えています。\n水色の瞳で登場し、画面に食らいつく彼女を描いてください。彼女がフレームから離れるときは、赤い目で、顔に血がにじむように描いてください。彼女の噛みつきはトランジションでお願いします。\n\nよろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1c0iFsklv6naVz9KVQKqE1Dhs1cJ4WCBp?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Okasi_na_Meno_1/works/48", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8896c53d/uploads/outputs/73818d17-0167-4244-ab53-4790e1cd252a?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=51e435a370deabf567f5071aec731cc3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8896c53d/uploads/outputs/73818d17-0167-4244-ab53-4790e1cd252a?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=51e435a370deabf567f5071aec731cc3, https://si.imgix.net/8896c53d/uploads/outputs/73818d17-0167-4244-ab53-4790e1cd252a?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eeec2f5b81e0c27e185c04d8619176e9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8896c53d/uploads/outputs/73818d17-0167-4244-ab53-4790e1cd252a?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ac5f1ff60c78e8a9e0e20fbecae571f6 3x", "genre": "video", "nsfw": false, "body": "hello めの壱-san !! I love the video animations you've made !! They're amazing and wonderful !\n\nI want to ask you if you can create a short video for me? I would like you to animate my Engineer character! I have a small storyboard for the direction -> https://imgur.com/a/1LitJ7t\n\nNote: When the screen is off, I'd like a little reflection of her face! Then when it turns on, I'd like it to be green to apply chroma key effect!\n\nhere's some information about her:\n\nShe's an Deer Engineer who loves crafting and tinkering. Her personality is bright yet very clumsy but is a hard worker! she loves to tinker with machines and computer parts in her workshop! sometimes the soybean mascot observes her while she's at work.\n\nI would like to use it for my livestreams and SNS~!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1DdL7h9HCFMbggTW